<title>UK: DIARY - Today in Westminster - Nov 15.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Today in Westminster - Nov 15.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The House of Commons ends its week on Friday with a debate on a government motion lauding what it describes as the success of its privatisation of Britain's railway system. -- London Newsroom +44 171 5427767</p>
